{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54249","headline":"六合怀古诗 城隍庙 · 郏滂","name":"六合怀古诗 城隍庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黥布城隍有感灵，只缘刘项霸江津。\n古来庙祝依然在，福荫江壖万万春。\n（〖1〗《嘉靖志》注：「《嘉定志》。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郏滂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}